// Incremental Virtual File System (`VFS`), `CompilerDB` & `IncrementalEngine` Bridge,
// Typed Generational Entity IDs (`LocalId`, `FunctionId`, `LspTypeId`, `PlaceId`, `LspSymbolId`),
// Span-Independent Identity Anchoring, and Partial-Program Syntax/HIR Recovery (T801 / E19.1).
// Implements SPEC-100 §1.2..1.7, §2.1..2.3 (AXS-LSP-001..007, AXS-LSP-011..012,
// REQ-TOOL-183, REQ-TOOL-184, REQ-TOOL-188, REQ-TOOL-191, REQ-TOOL-297, REQ-TOOL-298, REQ-TOOL-299).
